<title>USA: Troy, N.Y., $54 mln deal yields 5.65 pct in 2022.</title>
<headline>Troy, N.Y., $54 mln deal yields 5.65 pct in 2022.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
